  "question": {
    "text": "The reduction of peroxydisulphate ion by I ion\r\n\r\nis expressed by $\\mathrm{S}_{2} \\mathrm{O}_{8}^{2-}+3 \\mathrm{I}^{-} \\rightarrow 2 \\mathrm{SO}_{4}^{2-}+\\mathrm{I}_{3}^{-}$. If\r\n\r\nrate of disappearance of $\\mathrm{I}^{-}$ is $9 / 2 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{~mol}$ lit $^{-1}$\r\n\r\n$\\mathrm{s}^{-1},$ what is the rate of formation of $2 \\mathrm{SO}_{4}^{2-}$ during same time?",
    "image": null
  },
